{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-09-10", "prepared_on": "2026-09-10", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-09-10</div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> OpenAI Calls for Mandatory US AI Safety Regulations<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI籲美國制定強制AI安全規範</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI urged the US on Sept 9 to establish federal mandatory safety standards for frontier AI systems, requiring top labs to undergo capability-based testing, independent evaluation, and incident reporting.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI於9月9日呼籲美國建立聯邦層級的強制性AI安全規範，要求開發頂尖AI系統的業者依模型能力接受安全測試與獨立評估，並強化資安防護與重大事件通報。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178839\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Apple Unveils iPhone 18 Pro Lineup and First Foldable iPhone Duo<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">蘋果發表iPhone 18 Pro系列與首款摺疊機iPhone Duo</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Apple debuted its first foldable iPhone Duo alongside the iPhone 18 Pro and Pro Max, all powered by the new 2nm A20 Pro chip.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">蘋果周三發表首款摺疊機iPhone Duo，以及搭載2奈米A20 Pro晶片的iPhone 18 Pro與Pro Max。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178836\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Anthropic Researcher Resigns, Warns Self-Improving AI Could 'Kill Us All'<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">「拿人類性命下注」：Anthropic研究員辭職警告自我改進AI風險</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic researcher Jacob Coxon resigned over fears of an AI extinction risk, calling on labs to adopt pacing agreements before racing toward self-improving systems.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic研究員Jacob Coxon因擔憂AI滅絕風險而辭職，呼籲各實驗室在自我改進系統競賽前先建立節奏協議。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/09/gambling-with-our-lives-anthropic-researcher-quits-warns-against-self-improving-ai/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Over 9,300 Leaked AWS Keys Still Active, Some Grant Full Account Control<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">逾9,300個外洩AWS金鑰仍可用，數百個具企業帳號完整控制權</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Truffle Security found more than 9,300 publicly leaked AWS access keys from 2022-2026 remain valid, with hundreds granting full administrative control over enterprise accounts.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">資安業者Truffle Security發現2022至2026年間外洩的AWS金鑰中，逾9,300個至今仍有效，其中數百個擁有企業帳號完整管理權限。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178805\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Students Who Use AI Generally Score Worse in School, OECD Data Shows<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OECD報告：使用AI的學生在校成績普遍較差</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A global OECD PISA report finds students who rely on AI for studying tend to underperform peers who don't, though targeted, guided use shows a slight benefit.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OECD PISA全球教育報告指出，依賴AI學習的學生成績普遍不如未使用者，但在有引導的特定用法下略有助益。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/991956/student-ai-use-scores-oecd-pisa\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> OpenAI Launches GPT-6 Astra, Its Most Capable Model for Work<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI推出GPT-6 Astra，主打企業工作的最強模型</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI introduced GPT-6 Astra, its most capable business-focused model yet, featuring advanced reasoning, computer use, and stronger writing and design judgment.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI發表GPT-6 Astra，強調進階推理、電腦操作能力，以及更強的寫作與設計判斷力，鎖定企業使用情境。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">OpenAI</b> · <a href=\"https://openai.com/index/gpt-6-astra-next-generation-work\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> New Shai-Hulud Supply Chain Attack Plants Trinitite Worm in TanStack Query Package<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">新一波Shai-Hulud供應鏈攻擊，TanStack Query套件遭植入蠕蟲Trinitite</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Security firm JFrog uncovered a new Shai-Hulud campaign after finding the npm package @7nohe/openapi-react-query-codegen infected with a new Mini Shai-Hulud worm called Trinitite.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">資安業者JFrog揭露新一波Shai-Hulud供應鏈攻擊，發現npm套件@7nohe/openapi-react-query-codegen遭植入新型蠕蟲Trinitite。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178830\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Taiwan Launches Cross-Ministry AI Risk Review, Targets First Regulatory Update by 2027<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">數發部與八大部會啟動AI風險盤點，2027年前完成首輪法規調適</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Following Taiwan's AI Basic Act, the Ministry of Digital Affairs and eight ministries began an AI risk inventory to guide agencies in identifying risks under a shared governance framework.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">繼「人工智慧基本法」施行後，數發部與八大部會啟動AI風險盤點，協助各機關依統一治理框架辨識風險並推動法規調適。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178826\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> OpenAI's Math Breakthrough Claim Sparks Academic Controversy<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI數學突破宣稱引發學術爭議</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI's announcement that its AI agents solved the Navier-Stokes Millennium Prize problem has been overshadowed by accusations of academic impropriety, even as it signals AI's rapid impact on mathematics.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI宣稱其AI代理解出千禧年數學難題「納維-斯托克斯方程」，卻隨即遭指控涉及學術倫理爭議，同時也顯示AI對數學研究的衝擊之快。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">MIT Technology Review</b> · <a href=\"https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/09/08/1143747/what-openais-latest-controversy-tells-us-about-the-future-of-math/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Meta Launches Muse, a Personal AI Agent for Everyday Tasks<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Meta推出個人AI助理Muse</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Meta unveiled Muse, a consumer AI agent built on Muse Spark that can execute real tasks in a secure personal VM, overseen by a separate Sentinel agent that requires user consent for external actions.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Meta發表個人AI助理Muse，基於Muse Spark模型，能在專屬安全VM中執行實際任務，並由獨立的Sentinel代理監督，需經用戶同意才能對外執行動作。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178809\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}